    "abstract": false,
    "physical": true,
    "depth": 2,
    "description": "A disk in an asset (ADR-042): named by its tag (dsk-NN), its by-id name shown. Known by the asset it is in and its name; its serial is unique across all disks (asset-manager refuses a second). Moving it to another asset ends this CI and begins one there, so its history of placements is its CIs'. A pool is built-on it."
